{"ts": 0.130388, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mshells — gate\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[36mRecall\u001b[0m (three questions, all three must be correct).\r\n", "len": 93}
{"ts": 0.130437, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "First, three questions. Type your answer in words; this is not the shell.\r\n\r\nThen a \u001b[36mpractical task\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\n", "len": 112}
{"ts": 0.133225, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(the question again)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(save and leave)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 91}
{"ts": 0.133446, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 91}
{"ts": 0.13347, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.137323, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m|\u001b[0m 1 of 3   The shell runs the programs you name. What kind of thing is the\r\n", "len": 85}
{"ts": 0.137405, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "a program\n", "len": 10}
{"ts": 0.137437, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m|\u001b[0m          shell itself?\r\na program\r\n", "len": 46}
{"ts": 0.140834, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m|\u001b[0m          a program    a file    a folder    a window\r\n", "len": 65}
{"ts": 0.140865, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m|\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m| ?\u001b[0m ", "len": 25}
{"ts": 0.151705, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m|\u001b[0m \u001b[92m[x]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 27}
{"ts": 0.15511, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m|\u001b[0m 2 of 3   What do you type to ask whether zsh is installed?\r\n", "len": 71}
{"ts": 0.155179, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "command -v zsh\n", "len": 15}
{"ts": 0.155214, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m|\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m| ?\u001b[0m command -v zsh\r\n", "len": 41}
{"ts": 0.165701, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m|\u001b[0m \u001b[92m[x]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 27}
{"ts": 0.1696, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m|\u001b[0m 3 of 3   \u001b[92mecho $SHELL\u001b[0m prints which shell?\r\n", "len": 62}
{"ts": 0.169691, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "login shell\n", "len": 12}
{"ts": 0.169727, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "login shell\r\n", "len": 13}
{"ts": 0.173157, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m|\u001b[0m          the running one    your login shell    the newest one\r\n", "len": 75}
{"ts": 0.1732, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m|\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m| ?\u001b[0m ", "len": 25}
{"ts": 0.183502, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m|\u001b[0m \u001b[92m[x]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 27}
{"ts": 0.195166, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J", "len": 11}
{"ts": 0.196665, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m--\u001b[0m \u001b[90mModule\u001b[0m \u001b[90m------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m \u001b[93mshells  task\u001b[0m \u001b[90m--\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 127}
{"ts": 0.196698, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.196758, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mshells — task\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nFind out whether \u001b[92mzsh\u001b[0m is installed, and keep the answer in a file.\r\n", "len": 106}
{"ts": 0.196799, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n  1. Ask the shell where zsh is.\r\n  2. Send what it prints into a file named zsh.txt.\r\n\r\nIf zsh is not installed the file is empty, and that is a right answer.\r\n\u001b[90mThis task runs in the module's own folder; \u001b[92mpwd\u001b[90m shows it.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m> Do both steps, then type \u001b[92mcheck\u001b[93m.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 298}
{"ts": 0.199536, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mcheck\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(test your work)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(the task again)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(save and leave)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 132}
{"ts": 0.199753, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 91}
{"ts": 0.199767, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.215266, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.215387, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "command -v zsh > zsh.txt\n", "len": 25}
{"ts": 0.215431, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "command -v zsh > zsh.txt\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 35}
{"ts": 0.215746, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004h", "len": 8}
